      "id": "claim_c2c408a79a5f495fa0bf3c5b1efcccdb",
      "statement": "All data-channel traffic is proto3-framed Message bytes: a file id plus exactly one of metaData (name, size, type, encrypted AES key), chunk (file body slice), or receiveEvent (receiver control event); there is no ad-hoc text protocol on the channel.",
