      "statement": "The manual-exchange clipboard copy handlers are guarded (PR #79): copyOfferLink on the offer page and copyAnswerCode on the receive page wrap navigator.clipboard.writeText in try/catch, so a rejection (non-secure context, denied permission, unavailable API) toasts a 'Copy failed' error instead of escaping as an unhandled rejection that would let the user believe the link/answer code was copied when it was not.",
